\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090620230312&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Roasted_Dragon_Wings_23899a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  roasted dragon wings.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 8.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">You know why it's called 'dragon' when you feel the fire in your throat.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Chomp.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It will boost your shielding skill by 10 for one hour.\n</p><p>When using Roasted Dragon Wings, Fire Effect <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Fire Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Effect_4d816c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your shielding is improved for one hour.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 Fresh <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Bat\">Dead Bat</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_78810b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></li>\n<li>3 Jalapeño Peppers <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jalapeno Pepper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jalapeno_Pepper_02db27.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Bread\">Brown Breads</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Brown Bread\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brown_Bread_ec87ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Eggs</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Egg_e38eb8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Powder%20Herb\">Powder Herb</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Powder Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Powder_Herb_b0c31e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Mushroom\">Red Mushrooms</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Red Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Mushroom_5b1645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li></ul>\n<p>Obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>. There's a chance you'll find one when opening a <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chest</a> inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Falcon%20Bastion\">Falcon Bastion</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass-Shod%20Chest\">Brass-Shod Chest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Bread\">Brown Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Egg</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Powder%20Herb\">Powder Herb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Mushroom\">Red Mushroom</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","the-secret-library-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-2","n":9,"title":"Prato 3: Roasted Dragon Wings","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-